sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Authz
    participant Mongo

    Client->>Authz: /oauth2/authorize (with PKCE)
    Authz->>Mongo: Save OAuth2Authorization
    Client->>Authz: /oauth2/token (with code_verifier)
    Authz->>Mongo: Load Authorization
    Authz-->>Client: Access Token + Refresh Token
